description:
When this Class enters, create a 1/1 blue and red Otter creature token.

Level 2 — {3}{U}
Whenever you level up this Class, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.

Level 3 — {5}{U}
Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 blue and red Otter creature token.
